cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NYX, please cite the paper below."
title: "NYX: format-aware compression for omics files"
version: 1.0.0
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Georgakopoulos-Soares-lab/compression"
abstract: >-
  NYX losslessly compresses FASTA, FASTQ, VCF and BED files. A reversible,
  format-specific transform rewrites each file into homogeneous streams, which
  are compressed with pre-trained OpenZL graphs. Nothing is trained on the
  user's data and every round trip is byte-exact.
keywords:
  - compression
  - genomics
  - FASTA
  - FASTQ
  - VCF
  - BED
  - OpenZL
authors:
  - given-names: Michail
    family-names: Patsakis
  - given-names: Alexandros
    family-names: Margaris
  - given-names: Theodore
    family-names: Chronopoulos
  - given-names: Ioannis
    family-names: Mouratidis
  - given-names: Ilias
    family-names: Georgakopoulos-Soares
